{{Unobtainable}}
'''Aura''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 117
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Aura
|name2 = Aura CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Aura CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is completely useless due to the general attributes of Dark enemies being short-ranged pushers with high damage and many knockbacks, mitigating the need to use specialized knockback units as their high speed allows them to recover ground easily nevertheless. It is essentially a worse [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] that has less range, attack rate and speed in exchange for area attacks. Still, its damage is too low to be of any meaningful use and cannot falter Dark enemies, while its cooldown is unsalvageable. It is advisable to instead use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] for freezing and powerful attackers of your choice like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to damage them instead.

